; Bloodlines on the DS4, the fallback to a USB keyboard and mouse (milestone g, docs/ps4/HANDOFF-g.md):
; the d-pad walks (W A S D), the right stick looks (relative mouse moves), R2/L2 are the mouse buttons,
; cross jumps, circle uses (E), L1 crouches, R1 reloads, L3 is Shift, R3 quicksaves (F5), options is
; Escape. The touchpad, square and triangle are the title's marks and are never bound.
[input]
mode = keyboard
mouse = right_stick
mouse_speed = 1600
up = w
down = s
left = a
right = d
cross = space
circle = e
l1 = ctrl
r1 = r
r2 = mouse_left
l2 = mouse_right
options = escape
l3 = shift
r3 = f5
